*OpenUI *RasterSpeed/Raster Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 21 AnySetup *RasterSpeed
*DefaultRasterSpeed: 100
*RasterSpeed 10/10%: ""
*RasterSpeed 20/20%: ""
*RasterSpeed 30/30%: ""
*RasterSpeed 40/40%: ""
*RasterSpeed 50/50%: ""
*RasterSpeed 60/60%: ""
*RasterSpeed 70/70%: ""
*RasterSpeed 80/80%: ""
*RasterSpeed 90/90%: ""
*RasterSpeed 100/100%: ""
*CloseUI: *RasterSpeed

