*OrderDependency: 22 AnySetup *VectorPower
*DefaultVectorPower: 100
*VectorPower 0/0% (Off): ""
*VectorPower 10/10%: ""
*VectorPower 20/20%: ""
*VectorPower 30/30%: ""
*VectorPower 40/40%: ""
*VectorPower 50/50%: ""
*VectorPower 60/60%: ""
*VectorPower 70/70%: ""
