*PageSize Legal/US Legal (8.5" x 14"): "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Tabloid/Tabloid (11" x 17"): "<</PageSize[792 1224]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4 (210mm x 297mm): "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
